{"id":"c1","title":"official q1.1 hand-in · 官方 q1.1 提交作业（教师备课）","scope":"仅教师备课 · week 1 不完整讲解","source":"official problem sheet 1, q1.1; week 1 tutorial guidance, pages 3–4. hand-in due wednesday 30 september 2026 at 12:00 noon, for tutor feedback and not graded. do not go through in week 1. main solution follows the official tutor solution; rationale, checks, induction and alternative constructions are tutor expansions.","questionen":"(a) let $\mathbf u=\begin{pmatrix}1\\0\end{pmatrix}$ and $\mathbf v=\begin{pmatrix}1\\y\end{pmatrix}$ with $y\in\mathbb r$. compute $\|\mathbf u\|$, $\|\mathbf v\|$ and $\|\mathbf u+\mathbf v\|$, and determine for which $y\in\mathbb r$ we have $\|\mathbf u+\mathbf v\|=\|\mathbf u\|+\|\mathbf v\|$. sketch the vectors $\mathbf u$, $\mathbf v$ and $\mathbf u+\mathbf v$ in this case.

(b) let $\mathbf v_1,\mathbf v_2,\ldots,\mathbf v_k\in\mathbb r^n$ be $k$ arbitrary vectors in $\mathbb r^n$. use the triangle inequality to show that $\|\mathbf v_1+\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\|\mathbf v_1\|+\|\mathbf v_2\|+\cdots+\|\mathbf v_k\|$ and give an example of $k$ vectors for which there is equality.","questionzh":"(a) 设 $\mathbf u=\begin{pmatrix}1\\0\end{pmatrix}$、$\mathbf v=\begin{pmatrix}1\\y\end{pmatrix}$，其中 $y\in\mathbb r$。计算 $\|\mathbf u\|$、$\|\mathbf v\|$ 和 $\|\mathbf u+\mathbf v\|$，确定哪些 $y\in\mathbb r$ 满足 $\|\mathbf u+\mathbf v\|=\|\mathbf u\|+\|\mathbf v\|$，并在此情形下画出 $\mathbf u$、$\mathbf v$ 和 $\mathbf u+\mathbf v$。

(b) 设 $\mathbf v_1,\mathbf v_2,\ldots,\mathbf v_k\in\mathbb r^n$ 是 $k$ 个任意向量。利用三角不等式证明 $\|\mathbf v_1+\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\|\mathbf v_1\|+\|\mathbf v_2\|+\cdots+\|\mathbf v_k\|$，并给出一组使等号成立的 $k$ 个向量。","overview":{"en":"tutor-only preparation. the official tutorial guidance explicitly says this is the hand-in submitted in week 2: do not go through it in the week 1 tutorial; pointers on how to start are allowed. the solution below follows the official algebra and repeated triangle inequality, with our additional explanations, checks and alternative constructions. this is official problem sheet 1, q1.1 (website reference c1), due wednesday 30 september 2026 at 12:00 noon. it is for tutor feedback and is not graded; this is separate from the graded numbas quiz. staff-side solution visibility does not establish what a student account can see.","zh":"仅教师备课。官方指导明确说明：这是 week 2 提交的作业，不要在 week 1 tutorial 中完整讲解；允许提示如何开始。以下沿用官方代数与重复使用三角不等式的解法，补充我们自己的解释、检验和其他例子。 对应官方 problem sheet 1 的 q1.1（本网页索引 c1），截止时间为 2026 年 9 月 30 日周三中午 12:00。提交作业用于教师反馈、不计分，与计分的 numbas 测验不同。教师端能查看答案，不代表已验证学生账号也能查看。"},"prerequisites":[{"en":"$\|(a,b)\|=\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$; compute the vector sum before its norm. the two-vector triangle inequality applies to any pair of vectors in $\mathbb r^n$.","zh":"$\|(a,b)\|=\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$；必须先求和向量，再算它的范数。二向量三角不等式适用于 $\mathbb r^n$ 中任意两个向量。"},{"en":"squaring an equation is reversible if both sides are nonnegative. otherwise squaring can introduce false candidates, so a substitution check is essential.","zh":"等式两边都非负时，平方是可逆的；否则平方可能引入伪解，所以最后代回检验很重要。"}],"strategy":[{"en":"permissible week 1 hint for (a): “start by writing down the three lengths from their coordinates. what equation would express the requested equality?” stop before solving that equation or giving y.","zh":"week 1 可给的 (a) 提示：“先根据坐标写出三个长度。需要取等号时，会得到什么方程？”提示到这里即可，不要继续解方程或告诉学生 y。"},{"en":"permissible week 1 hint for (b): “the triangle inequality handles two vectors. can you regard part of this long sum as a single vector?” ask students to show each application clearly; do not give the complete chain or an equality example in the tutorial.","zh":"week 1 可给的 (b) 提示：“三角不等式处理两个向量。能否把这一长串和的一部分看成一个向量？”提醒写清每次使用的对象，不在 tutorial 给出完整链条或取等号例子。"},{"en":"for your own preparation: (a) isolate a square root after one squaring, then check reversibility. for (b), successively split one vector off; construct equality by avoiding any change of direction or cancellation.","zh":"教师自己备课时：(a) 平方一次后，把一个根式单独留下，并核对步骤是否可逆；(b) 每次从和里拆出一个向量。构造等号例子时，让方向不变、没有抵消。"}],"steps":[{"en":"(a), lengths: $\|\mathbf u\|=1$, $\|\mathbf v\|=\sqrt{1+y^2}$, and $\mathbf u+\mathbf v=(2,y)$, so $\|\mathbf u+\mathbf v\|=\sqrt{4+y^2}$.","zh":"(a)，先求长度：$\|\mathbf u\|=1$，$\|\mathbf v\|=\sqrt{1+y^2}$；而 $\mathbf u+\mathbf v=(2,y)$，所以 $\|\mathbf u+\mathbf v\|=\sqrt{4+y^2}$。"},{"en":"the required equation is $\sqrt{4+y^2}=1+\sqrt{1+y^2}$. both sides are positive for every real $y$, so squaring is an equivalence, not merely an implication.","zh":"要求满足的方程为 $\sqrt{4+y^2}=1+\sqrt{1+y^2}$。对任意实数 $y$，两边都为正，因此平方是等价变形，而不只是单向推导。"},{"en":"square and expand the whole right-hand side: $4+y^2=1+2\sqrt{1+y^2}+(1+y^2)=2+y^2+2\sqrt{1+y^2}$. cancel $y^2$ and rearrange to get $\sqrt{1+y^2}=1$.","zh":"平方时必须展开右边整个和：$4+y^2=1+2\sqrt{1+y^2}+(1+y^2)=2+y^2+2\sqrt{1+y^2}$。消去 $y^2$ 并整理，得到 $\sqrt{1+y^2}=1$。"},{"en":"both sides are again nonnegative, so square once more: $1+y^2=1$, hence $y^2=0$ and $\boxed{y=0}$. substitution verifies $\sqrt4=1+\sqrt1=2$, proving necessity and sufficiency.","zh":"两边仍然非负，再平方得 $1+y^2=1$，因此 $y^2=0$，即 $\boxed{y=0}$。代回原式有 $\sqrt4=1+\sqrt1=2$，所以既证明了必要性，也验证了充分性。"},{"en":"sketch at $y=0$: $\mathbf u=\mathbf v=(1,0)$ and $\mathbf u+\mathbf v=(2,0)$. draw two labelled, overlapping arrows from $(0,0)$ to $(1,0)$ and a longer arrow to $(2,0)$. a second head-to-tail picture places a translated copy of $\mathbf v$ from $(1,0)$ to $(2,0)$.","zh":"$y=0$ 时作图：$\mathbf u=\mathbf v=(1,0)$，$\mathbf u+\mathbf v=(2,0)$。从 $(0,0)$ 向 $(1,0)$ 画重叠的箭头并标出 u、v，再向 $(2,0)$ 画较长的和向量。另画首尾相接图时，把 v 平移到从 $(1,0)$ 指向 $(2,0)$。"},{"en":"(b), take a positive integer $k$. for $k=1$ the statement is equality. for $k\ge2$, apply the triangle inequality to $\mathbf v_1$ and $\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k$: $\|\mathbf v_1+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\|\mathbf v_1\|+\|\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|$.","zh":"(b)，设 $k$ 是正整数。$k=1$ 时结论直接取等号。$k\ge2$ 时，先把 $\mathbf v_1$ 与 $\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k$ 当作两个向量使用三角不等式：$\|\mathbf v_1+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\|\mathbf v_1\|+\|\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|$。"},{"en":"now split the remaining sum again. for example, if $k\ge3$, $\|\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\|\mathbf v_2\|+\|\mathbf v_3+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|$. substitute this upper bound into the previous line.","zh":"继续把剩下的和拆开。例如 $k\ge3$ 时，$\|\mathbf v_2+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\|\mathbf v_2\|+\|\mathbf v_3+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|$。再把这个上界代回上一行。"},{"en":"after $k-1$ applications, no unsplit sum remains: $\boxed{\|\mathbf v_1+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\sum_{j=1}^{k}\|\mathbf v_j\|}$. each step bounds a two-vector sum; we have not assumed the very multi-vector result we are proving.","zh":"共使用 $k-1$ 次后，不再有需要拆分的和，得到 $\boxed{\|\mathbf v_1+\cdots+\mathbf v_k\|\le\sum_{j=1}^{k}\|\mathbf v_j\|}$。每一步用的都是二向量版本，不能把要证明的多向量版本当作已知直接引用。"},{"en":"official equality example: choose any fixed $\mathbf q\in\mathbb r^n$ and set every $\mathbf v_j=\mathbf q$. then the left side is $\|k\mathbf q\|=k\|\mathbf q\|$, exactly the sum of the $k$ norms on the right. this includes $\mathbf q=\mathbf0$.","zh":"官方给出的等号例子：任选固定的 $\mathbf q\in\mathbb r^n$，令每个 $\mathbf v_j=\mathbf q$。左边为 $\|k\mathbf q\|=k\|\mathbf q\|$，恰好等于右边 $k$ 个范数的和。也允许 $\mathbf q=\mathbf0$。"},{"en":"source note: the official solution’s opening line for (b) writes v₁,…,vₙ while describing k vectors. we use v₁,…,vₖ consistently, matching the question and its inequality; n remains the dimension, not the number of vectors.","zh":"原文校勘：官方 (b) 解答首行写成 v₁,…,vₙ，同时又说有 k 个向量。这里统一写为 v₁,…,vₖ，与题目和不等式一致；n 是维数，不是向量个数。"}],"say":{"en":"for today, i can help you start: write the lengths from the coordinates, and think about applying the triangle inequality to two grouped vectors. leave the complete argument for your own hand-in, and explain each step in full sentences.","zh":"今天我可以帮助你起步：由坐标写出长度，并考虑怎样把和分成两个向量来使用三角不等式。完整推理留给你自己的提交作业，每一步用完整句子解释清楚。"},"pitfalls":[{"en":"do not write $(1+\sqrt{1+y^2})^2=1+(1+y^2)$; the cross term $2\sqrt{1+y^2}$ is essential.","zh":"不能写 $(1+\sqrt{1+y^2})^2=1+(1+y^2)$；交叉项 $2\sqrt{1+y^2}$ 不能漏掉。"},{"en":"do not claim equality is possible only when all vectors are equal. that is one convenient example, not a necessary condition.","zh":"不能说只有所有向量相等才能取等号。那只是一个方便的例子，不是必要条件。"},{"en":"collinearity alone is not sufficient: nonzero vectors in opposite directions can cancel. construct examples with nonnegative multiples of one fixed vector.","zh":"仅仅共线不够，反向非零向量会抵消。构造时可使用同一固定向量的非负倍数。"},{"en":"this complete answer is visible on this public tutor-preparation page. “tutor-only” is a teaching-use label, not access control. do not share or project this solution to students in the week 1 tutorial.","zh":"完整答案可以在这个公开备课页面看到。“仅教师备课”是用途标签，不是访问权限控制。week 1 tutorial 不要向学生分享或投影这份完整解答。"}],"alternatives":[{"en":"induction proof: the $k=1$ case is immediate. assume $\|\sum_{j=1}^{m}\mathbf v_j\|\le\sum_{j=1}^{m}\|\mathbf v_j\|$. then $\|\sum_{j=1}^{m+1}\mathbf v_j\|\le\|\sum_{j=1}^{m}\mathbf v_j\|+\|\mathbf v_{m+1}\|\le\sum_{j=1}^{m+1}\|\mathbf v_j\|$. this proves the result for every positive integer k.","zh":"归纳法：$k=1$ 直接成立。假设 $\|\sum_{j=1}^{m}\mathbf v_j\|\le\sum_{j=1}^{m}\|\mathbf v_j\|$，则 $\|\sum_{j=1}^{m+1}\mathbf v_j\|\le\|\sum_{j=1}^{m}\mathbf v_j\|+\|\mathbf v_{m+1}\|\le\sum_{j=1}^{m+1}\|\mathbf v_j\|$。因此对所有正整数 k 成立。"},{"en":"nonunique equality construction: choose any $\mathbf q$ and any real coefficients $t_j\ge0$, and set $\mathbf v_j=t_j\mathbf q$. then $\|\sum_j\mathbf v_j\|=(\sum_j t_j)\|\mathbf q\|=\sum_j\|\mathbf v_j\|$. lengths may differ, and some vectors may be zero.","zh":"非唯一的等号构造：任选 $\mathbf q$ 和非负实数 $t_j\ge0$，令 $\mathbf v_j=t_j\mathbf q$。则 $\|\sum_j\mathbf v_j\|=(\sum_j t_j)\|\mathbf q\|=\sum_j\|\mathbf v_j\|$。各向量长度可以不同，其中一些也可以为零。"},{"en":"concrete example for arbitrary k and n≥1: let $\mathbf e_1=(1,0,\ldots,0)$ and $\mathbf v_j=j\mathbf e_1$. both sides equal $1+2+\cdots+k=k(k+1)/2$. we choose this because every arrow points along the same positive axis, so no length is lost through turning or cancellation.","zh":"对任意 k 和 n≥1 的具体例子：令 $\mathbf e_1=(1,0,\ldots,0)$、$\mathbf v_j=j\mathbf e_1$。两边都等于 $1+2+\cdots+k=k(k+1)/2$。这样构造，是因为所有箭头都朝同一条正半轴，没有转弯或抵消带来的长度损失。"},{"en":"geometric check for (a): both vectors have first component 1. equality requires the same direction. if $(1,y)=t(1,0)$ with $t\ge0$, the first component forces $t=1$ and the second forces $y=0$. this checks, rather than replaces, the requested norm computation.","zh":"(a) 的几何检验：两个向量的第一分量都为 1，等号要求同向。若 $(1,y)=t(1,0)$ 且 $t\ge0$，第一分量迫使 $t=1$，第二分量迫使 $y=0$。这是对结果的检验，不能取代题目要求的范数计算。"}]}
